      "script": "Here is the fundamental problem with AI assistants today: no persistent context. You use ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini — but every time you open a new conversation, you start from zero. They do not know who you are, what you worked on yesterday, or what your current projects look like. And that costs time and money for any serious business."
