      "script": "OpenHuman is an open-source AI assistant that solves exactly this. It runs on your desktop, stores memory locally with complete privacy, and connects to over 118 tools you already use — Gmail, Notion, GitHub, Slack, Stripe, Google Calendar. One-click OAuth setup, and it starts learning everything about your work automatically."
