      "diagram_url": "https://mermaid.-?bgColor=0f0f1a",
      "script": "To prevent your AI costs from exploding, they built TokenJuice. Before sending any data to the language model, the system automatically compresses it — converts HTML to Markdown, shortens URLs, removes redundancies. The result? Up to 80 percent reduction in costs and latency. For a company using AI heavily every day, that is a significant competitive advantage."
